{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":20781979,"ns":0,"title":"Andronov–Pontryagin criterion","extract":"The Andronov–Pontryagin criterion is a necessary and sufficient condition for the stability of dynamical systems in the plane. It was derived by Aleksandr Andronov and Lev Pontryagin in 1937.","description":"Mathematics concept","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}